@startuml F5.4-D03-deliberar-sem-deeplink
title F5.4-D03 — Deliberar sem deep-link
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: /solicitacoes/{id}/deliberar
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /requests/{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT + _links
Postgres --> WebApp: 200 detalhe
Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar decisão
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /requests/{id}/deliberate
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: UPDATE + event\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Sec: fila atualizada

@enduml
